<title>AUSTRIA: Austria calls for repo bids at unchanged 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria calls for repo bids at unchanged 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian central bank said on Thursday it was calling for bids for two-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged rate of three percent.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0900 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank awarded 10.28 billion schillings in two-week repos, filling 12 percent of bids. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254</p>
